    'commercialWorkboats.a1': 'Yoga at Studio Wear',
    'commercialWorkboats.a1desc': 'Katamtamang timbang na 180-220gsm four-way stretch na tela na may moisture-wicking para sa walang-hadlang na paggalaw',
    'commercialWorkboats.a2': 'Pagtakbo at Pagsasanay',
